        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "When looking for alternative solutions, I found that `fs_realpath` works as well to remove the reliance on `ino` and `dev`, but I realised that it would not work for symbolic links. In the process, I also realised that `fs_lstat` should be used in place of `fs_stat` (same issue with symbolic links). I updated my branch to use `fs_lstat` and I'll leave it up to you to decide if you think the concerns you pointed out are surmountable or not.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time in any case! (and still very happy with `mini.nvim` as a long-time user).",
