        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Maybe it is indeed a hairy-enough issue to leave it unsolved. _Failing_ the rename is more safe than risking overwriting another file in case the user is renaming things on a case-sensitive filesystem on Darwin/Windows.",
